<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Shipping & Returns | REVIVO</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/user/header') %>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-8 md:mb-12 text-[#2C2C2C]">Shipping & Returns</h1>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Commitment</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          At REVIVO, we're committed to making your shopping experience as seamless as possible. We offer transparent shipping policies and a hassle-free return process to ensure your complete satisfaction.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about shipping, delivery, or returns that aren't answered below, please don't hesitate to <a href="/contact" class="text-[#2C2C2C] underline">contact our customer service team</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border-b border-gray-200 mb-8 pb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Shipping Information</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Shipping Methods & Timeframes</h3>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
          <table class="min-w-full border border-gray-200">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-wider border-b">Shipping Method</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-wider border-b">Estimated Delivery</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 uppercase tracking-wider border-b">Cost</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200">
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">Standard Shipping</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">3-5 Business Days</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">$5.95 (Free on orders over $75)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">Express Shipping</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">1-2 Business Days</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">$12.95</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">Next Day Delivery</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">Next Business Day (order by 12pm EST)</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">$19.95</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">International Shipping</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">7-14 Business Days</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-700">Calculated at checkout</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Order Processing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Orders are typically processed within 1-2 business days after payment confirmation. During peak seasons or promotional periods, processing may take an additional 1-2 days. You'll receive a shipping confirmation email with tracking information once your order has been dispatched.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">International Shipping</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          We ship to most countries worldwide. International customers may be subject to import duties, taxes, and customs clearance fees, which are the responsibility of the recipient and are not included in the shipping cost. Delivery times for international orders may vary depending on customs processing in your country.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Tracking Your Order</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          You can track your order in the following ways:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Log into your REVIVO account and view your order history</li>
          <li>Click the tracking link in your shipping confirmation email</li>
          <li>Contact our customer service team with your order number</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border-b border-gray-200 mb-8 pb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Returns & Exchanges</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Return Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          We want you to be completely satisfied with your REVIVO purchase. If you're not entirely happy with your order, we offer a simple return policy:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Returns accepted within 30 days of delivery</li>
          <li>Items must be unworn, unwashed, and in their original condition with all tags attached</li>
          <li>Original packaging should be included when possible</li>
          <li>Sale items marked as "Final Sale" cannot be returned or exchanged</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">How to Return an Item</h3>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 mb-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Log into your REVIVO account and navigate to your order history</li>
          <li>Select the order containing the item(s) you wish to return</li>
          <li>Follow the prompts to initiate your return and generate a return shipping label</li>
          <li>Package your return securely with the return form included in your original shipment</li>
          <li>Attach the return shipping label to your package</li>
          <li>Drop off your package at an authorized shipping location</li>
        </ol>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Refund Process</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Once we receive and inspect your return, we'll process your refund within 3-5 business days. Refunds will be issued to the original payment method used for the purchase. Please allow an additional 2-7 business days for the refund to appear in your account, depending on your financial institution.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Exchanges</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          We currently don't offer direct exchanges. If you need a different size or color, please return your item for a refund and place a new order for the desired item. This ensures the item you want is still in stock and available for immediate shipment.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Return Shipping Costs</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          For domestic returns, a flat fee of $5.95 will be deducted from your refund to cover return shipping costs. Returns due to defects, damages, or errors on our part are free of charge.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
            <button class="flex justify-between items-center w-full px-6 py-4 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
              <span class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">When will I receive my order?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200">
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                After placing your order, you'll receive an order confirmation email. Once your order ships (typically within 1-2 business days), you'll receive a shipping confirmation email with tracking information. Delivery timeframes depend on your chosen shipping method.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
            <button class="flex justify-between items-center w-full px-6 py-4 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
              <span class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Can I change or cancel my order?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200">
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                You can modify or cancel your order within 1 hour of placing it by contacting our customer service team. After this window, we begin processing orders and cannot guarantee changes or cancellations.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
            <button class="flex justify-between items-center w-full px-6 py-4 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
              <span class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">What if my item arrives damaged?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200">
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                If your item arrives damaged or defective, please contact our customer service team within 48 hours of delivery. Include your order number and photos of the damaged item. We'll arrange a free return and replacement or refund.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
            <button class="flex justify-between items-center w-full px-6 py-4 text-left bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
              <span class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">Do you ship to PO boxes?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200">
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                Yes, we ship to PO boxes for standard shipping only. Express and Next Day delivery options require a physical address.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Need More Help?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Our customer service team is here to assist you with any questions about shipping, returns, or your order.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-black transition duration-300">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/faq" class="border border-[#2C2C2C] text-[#2C2C2C] px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-100 transition duration-300">View FAQs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
